### Create User
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Ram",
    "email":"ram@mail.com",
    "dateOfBirth":"2000-09-12",
    "mobileNumber":9999999999
}

### Read all Users
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/users

### Read a User by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69a68244c14d042b5dd7f4b1

### Delete a uUser by ID
DELETE   http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69a68244c14d042b5dd7f4b1

### Activate User
PATCH http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69a68244c14d042b5dd7f4b1